# PAM stack for lion-greeter (spec 01 §3 Authentication).
#
# Full conversation support: password, expired-password change
# (pam_unix), account lock-out (pam_faillock) — the greeter surfaces
# faillock denials as `Throttle`/locked reasons over its UI socket.
#
# No session-* lines: the greeter registers the logind session itself
# and execs lion-session as the user (see launch.rs).

auth     required  pam_faillock.so preauth silent deny=4 unlock_time=120
auth     required  pam_unix.so
auth     optional  pam_fprintd.so   # fingerprint with automatic password fallback
account  required  pam_faillock.so
account  required  pam_unix.so
password required  pam_unix.so      # expired-password change flow
